      ],
      "updated": 1783702728491,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A persona is a fictional profile  (काल्पनिक चित्र वा प्रोफाइल\n) representing a specific segment of your target\naudience, used to help businesses deeply understand\nand connect with their ideal customers\n\nCore Elements of a Persona\n-----------------------------------\nDemographics: Age, location, occupation, and\nhousehold income.\n\nPsychographics: Values, core interests, lifestyles, and\nprofessional goals.\n\nPain Points: Challenges, frustrations, or roadblocks\nthey face daily.\n\nBehavior Patterns: Preferred social media networks,\nbuying habits, and brand loyalties.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A persona is a fictional profile  (काल्पनिक चित्र वा प्रोफाइल ) representing a specific segment of your target audience, used to help businesses deeply understand and connect with their ideal customers\n\nCore Elements of a Persona\n-----------------------------------\nDemographics: Age, location, occupation, and household income.\n\nPsychographics: Values, core interests, lifestyles, and professional goals.\n\nPain Points: Challenges, frustrations, or roadblocks they face daily.\n\nBehavior Patterns: Preferred social media networks, buying habits, and brand loyalties.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
